   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 29.002,
   "speechEnd": 31.371
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "另一些基准给出的数字更冷静。",
   "spoken": "另一些基准给出的数字更冷静。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 32.436,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 32.534,
   "speechEnd": 34.712
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "EVMbench 和后续复评里，最佳检测率约 46%。",
   "spoken": "EVMbench 和后续复评里，最佳检测率约 46%。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 35.752,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 35.85,
   "speechEnd": 40.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "在 22 起真实事件上，没有一组智能体完成端到端的利用。",
   "spoken": "在 22 起真实事件上，没有一组智能体完成端到端的利用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 41.156,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 41.254,
   "speechEnd": 45.825
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "AI 在降低利用漏洞的成本，但在真实的复杂系统上，仍明显弱于基准表现。",
   "spoken": "AI 在降低利用漏洞的成本，但在真实的复杂系统上，仍明显弱于基准表现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 46.896,
   "dur": 6.936,
   "speechStart": 46.994,
   "speechEnd": 52.994
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "对防守方来说，最确定的影响是，修复要更快。",
   "spoken": "对防守方来说，最确定的影响是，修复要更快。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 54.052,
   "dur": 4.704,
   "speechStart": 54.15,
   "speechEnd": 57.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "AI 写的代码，同样会出错。",
   "spoken": "AI 写的代码，同样会出错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 58.976,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 59.074,
   "speechEnd": 61.264
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "2026 年 2 月，Moonwell 上线新的价格包装器，cbETH 只取了它对 ETH 的汇率，漏乘 ETH 的美元价格。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 2 月，Moonwell 上线新的价格包装器，cbETH 只取了它对 ETH 的汇率，漏乘 ETH 的美元价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 62.316,
   "dur": 9.504,
   "speechStart": 62.414,
   "speechEnd": 70.985
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "cbETH 被定价成约 1.12 美元，引发大量清算，留下约 178 万美元坏账。",
   "spoken": "cbETH 被定价成约 1.12 美元，引发大量清算，留下约 178 万美元坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 72.04,
   "dur": 7.512,
   "speechStart": 72.138,
   "speechEnd": 78.709
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "相关提交里，有 AI 编程助手署名的共同作者。",
   "spoken": "相关提交里，有 AI 编程助手署名的共同作者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 79.772,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 79.87,
   "speechEnd": 83.965
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "项目方没有把事故归因于 AI，人类同样会犯这个错。",
   "spoken": "项目方没有把事故归因于 AI，人类同样会犯这个错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 85.032,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 85.13,
   "speechEnd": 88.856
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "2025 年 7 月，一个假的 Solidity 扩展上架插件市场，一名区块链开发者被盗约 50 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 7 月，一个假的 Solidity 扩展上架插件市场，一名区块链开发者被盗约 50 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 89.908,
   "dur": 8.424,
   "speechStart": 90.006,
   "speechEnd": 97.494
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "模型还会编出不存在的包名，攻击者抢先注册，这叫幻觉包名。",
   "spoken": "模型还会编出不存在的包名，攻击者抢先注册，这叫幻觉包名。",
